From: ViKing <viking.yfy@qq.com>
Date: Tue, 27 Oct 2026 09:40:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] net: ethernet: qualcomm: manage virtual port uplink ownership

Consolidate consecutive changes within this functional responsibility.
Retain the final implementation and its error handling directly.

Merged from:
  0657-net-ethernet-qualcomm-ppe-optimize-vp-uplink-tx.patch
  0658-net-ethernet-qualcomm-ppe-protect-vp-uplink-handoff.patch
  0659-net-ethernet-qualcomm-ppe-quiesce-vp-carrier-tx.patch
  0661-net-ethernet-qualcomm-ppe-initialize-vp-network-header.patch

Signed-off-by: ViKing <viking.yfy@qq.com>

